  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry about tonight's order, Hannah. Here's where it stands.\n\n**Late delivery:** You were right. The order was due at 6:00 PM and was handed to you at 6:50 PM, 50 minutes late. For deliveries 45 minutes or more late, we give account credit of 20% of the order subtotal. I've added **$12.00** (20% of $60.00) to your account, and you can use it on your next order.\n\n**Missing mango lassi:** You ordered two and got one, so I can make up for the missing one ($4.50). Which would you prefer?\n- **$4.50 refunded** to your Visa ending 4242, or\n- **$5.40 in account credit** (the price plus 20%)\n\nOnce you choose, I'll take care of it and we can move on to the Pho Real order."
