   "text": "I checked, and the iced coffee has already been refunded.\n\nThe restaurant marked it **unavailable** at 12:20 PM, before your order left. Our system then **automatically refunded $4.75** to your Visa ending 4242 at 12:21 PM. Card refunds often take a few business days to show on your statement, which is probably why you haven't seen it yet.\n\nSince that refund has already gone through, I can't compensate for the iced coffee again. Everything else on the order checks out: it arrived at 12:50 PM, before the promised 12:55 PM.\n\nNext is the **Burger Barn order (K-6102)** from last night. What happened with that one?"
